{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47293","headline":"览古十四首 六 · 吴筠","name":"览古十四首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝稽真仙道，清寂祛衆烦。\n秦皇及汉武，焉得游其藩。\n情扰万机屑，位骄四海尊。\n既欲先宇宙，仍规後乾坤。\n崇高与久远，物莫能两存。\n矧乃恣所慾，荒淫伐灵根。\n金膏恃延期，玉色复动魂。\n征战穷外域，杀伤被中原。\n天鉴谅难诬，神理不可谖。\n安期返蓬莱，王母还崑仑。\n异术终莫告，悲哉竟何言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}